<https://w3id.org/lcanet/core#LcaModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The LCA model class represents a complete Life Cycle Assessment instance within the LCAnet ontology network. \nIts instance ID encapsulates all aspects of the LCA study, linking to scope, goal, life cycle stages, and interpretation results." .
