<https://w3id.org/lcanet/core#LifeCycleStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The LifeCycle stage class enumerates the standard stages of a product or service life cycle, providing an exhaustive list of the five possible stages for classification and analysis within the LCA." .
