<https://w3id.org/lcanet/core#Scope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Scope class captures the boundaries and context of an LCA study, including spatial and temporal aspects, functional unit, system boundaries, and assumptions, and a reference flow. Each element is represented via data properties connecting the Scope class to its corresponding values." .
